 <h2><b>How to choose a ring based on its material and color to attract wealth</b></h2>

<p> <span>In addition to paying attention to which finger to wear the ring to attract fortune, another equally important thing that men need to pay attention to when choosing a ring is:</span></p>

<h3> <b>Ring shape and pattern</b>
</h3>

<p> <span>The shape of the ring is also an important factor affecting the attraction of fortune, so men need to choose carefully. With strange patterns, it will not be good for fortune, sometimes even bring bad luck to work and career.</span></p>

 <p><span>So to attract wealth, men should choose rings with simple designs and round shapes, because this shape of ring symbolizes fulfillment and wealth.</span></p>

<h3> <b>Material and color of the ring</b>
</h3>

<p> <span>Which finger men wear a ring to attract fortune is also related to the color and material of the ring, so men should prioritize choosing <span><a href="https://helios.vn/collections/nhan-bac-nam" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>silver, gold or platinum rings</strong></a></span> . These materials will help the wearer not lose money.</span></p>

 <p><a href="https://helios.vn/collections/nhan-bac-nam/products/gothic-tiger-eye-v2-helios-silver" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/nhan-bac-phong-thuy_480x480.jpg?v=1725014541" alt="" loading="lazy" width="384" height="480"></span></a></p>

<p> <span>In particular, the colors of the rings also need to match the theory of the five elements to bring luck and fortune. In the theory of the five elements, each destiny will have a color corresponding to different color tones such as:</span> </p>

<ul>

<li>

<span> </span><span>People with water element are suitable for green, pink, purple, red.</span>

</li>

<li> 
<span> </span><span>For people with metal destiny, yellow, amber, and white are suitable.</span> 

</li>

<li>

<span> </span><span>People with the Wood element are compatible with black, blue, sky blue and navy blue.</span> 

</li>

<li>

<span> </span><span>People with the Earth element will be compatible with pink, purple, red or earthy yellow.</span>

</li>


</ul>

 <p><span>Therefore, depending on your destiny, choosing a ring with the corresponding color will bring fortune and luck.</span></p>

